<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY WEATHER - MOSTLY CLOUDY, 16-19 C - JUNE 2.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY WEATHER - MOSTLY CLOUDY, 16-19 C - JUNE 2.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostly cloudy, with rain showers and storm likely the west. Winds moderate. Highs of 16 to 19 C.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
